  "diagrams": {
    "hld": {
      "title": "High-Level Design",
      "mermaid": "flowchart TD\n  subgraph Firmware[\"Firmware\"]\n    app[\"Application coordinator<br/>firmware/app/app.c\"]\n    climate[\"Climate sampling service<br/>firmware/services/climate_service.c\"]\n    dhtport[\"DHT22 GPIO and frame adapter<br/>firmware/platforms/stm32/platform_dht22.c\"]\n    motion[\"Motion sampling service<br/>firmware/services/motion_service.c\"]\n    processor[\"Motion scaling and event detection<br/>firmware/modules/motion_processor.c\"]\n    motionport[\"MPU6050 platform adapter<br/>firmware/platforms/stm32/platform_motion.c\"]\n    bus[\"Shared I2C bus adapter<br/>firmware/platforms/stm32/platform_i2c1.c\"]\n    alert[\"Alert indication policy<br/>firmware/modules/alert_indicator.c\"]\n    indicator[\"LED platform adapter<br/>firmware/platforms/stm32/platform_indicator.c\"]\n    logger[\"UART logging adapter<br/>firmware/platforms/stm32/platform_logger.c\"]\n  end\n  subgraph Devices[\"Connected devices and interfaces\"]\n    dht[\"Climate sensor<br/>DHT22 data on PB4\"]\n    timer[\"Microsecond capture timer<br/>TIM3\"]\n    mpu[\"Motion sensor<br/>MPU6050 address 0x68\"]\n    i2c[\"I2C1 bus<br/>SCL PB8, SDA PB9\"]\n    led[\"User indicator LED<br/>LD4 on PA5\"]\n    uart[\"Virtual COM port<br/>USART2 TX PA2, RX PA3\"]\n  end\n  app -->|climate_service_poll| climate\n  climate -->|climate_port_read| dhtport\n  dhtport -->|single-wire data| dht\n  timer -->|counter capture via __HAL_TIM_GET_COUNTER| dhtport\n  app -->|motion_service_poll| motion\n  motion -->|motion_processor_process| processor\n  motion -->|motion_port_read_acceleration| motionport\n  motionport -->|i2c_bus_read_register| bus\n  bus -->|HAL_I2C transfers| i2c\n  i2c -->|register access at 0x68| mpu\n  app -->|alert_indicator_update| alert\n  app -->|indicator_port_set| indicator\n  indicator -->|HAL_GPIO_WritePin on PA5| led\n  app -->|LOGI, LOGW, LOGE and telemetry writes| logger\n  logger -->|platform_uart2_write#59; HAL_UART_Transmit| uart",
      "authored_by_model": true,
      "node_notes": {
        "timer": "TIM3 supplies the free-running counter used to measure DHT22 pulse widths. firmware/platforms/stm32/platform_dht22.c initializes and starts TIM3 and reads its counter during capture.",
        "dhtport": "This STM32 adapter drives PB4 low, releases it for DHT22 responses, captures the frame, and delegates frame validation to the decoder. The GPIO and timing implementation is in firmware/platforms/stm32/platform_dht22.c.",
        "i2c": "I2C1 is the shared bus used for MPU6050 register transfers and the startup address scan. firmware/platforms/stm32/platform_i2c1.c configures PB8 as SCL and PB9 as SDA and performs the HAL I2C operations.",
        "indicator": "This adapter initializes and writes the board indicator using HAL_GPIO_WritePin. firmware/platforms/stm32/platform_indicator.c uses APP_LED4_GPIO_PIN, configured as PA5 in firmware/configs/app_config.h.",
        "logger": "This platform adapter bridges logger output to the UART2 write API. Its implementation in firmware/platforms/stm32/platform_logger.c calls platform_uart2_write.",
        "led": "LD4 is the board indicator driven to reflect the alert policy output. The platform writes PA5 through HAL_GPIO_WritePin in firmware/platforms/stm32/platform_indicator.c.",
        "climate": "This service enforces the DHT22 sampling cadence and maps platform read results into climate readings. Its polling API is climate_service_poll in firmware/services/climate_service.c.",
        "bus": "This adapter serializes I2C transfers and configures the I2C1 pins as alternate-function open-drain. firmware/platforms/stm32/platform_i2c1.c binds SCL to PB8 and SDA to PB9 through APP_I2C1_SCL_PIN and APP_I2C1_SDA_PIN.",
        "dht": "The DHT22 provides climate data over the project's single-wire PB4 connection. That pin binding is declared by APP_DHT22_DATA_PIN in firmware/configs/app_config.h and used by the STM32 DHT22 adapter.",
        "mpu": "The MPU6050 supplies motion samples and is configured at the confirmed seven-bit address 0x68. firmware/configs/app_config.h sets that address, and firmware/drivers/mpu6050/mpu6050.c reads and writes its registers.",
        "uart": "USART2 carries logging and application telemetry to the ST-LINK Virtual COM Port. firmware/platforms/stm32/platform_uart2.c configures TX on PA2 and RX on PA3 and sends bytes with HAL_UART_Transmit.",
        "app": "This coordinator initializes the bus, climate service, indicator, and motion service, then polls the application services. It is implemented by app_start and app_poll_services in firmware/app/app.c.",
        "motionport": "This adapter initializes the MPU6050 and turns service reads into driver operations through the shared I2C bus. Register access and the configured address 0x68 are evidenced in firmware/platforms/stm32/platform_motion.c and firmware/configs/app_config.h.",
        "motion": "This service gates MPU6050 sampling to the configured cadence and retains pending events for the application. Its initialization and polling APIs are in firmware/services/motion_service.c.",
        "processor": "This module scales raw acceleration, calibrates offsets, and classifies motion events from sample windows. Its processing policy is implemented in firmware/modules/motion_processor.c.",
        "alert": "This module selects and holds the active motion alert and computes the LED blink phase. Its policy is implemented by alert_indicator_update in firmware/modules/alert_indicator.c."
      }
    },
